{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18403","headline":"谢真人仙驾还旧山 · 夏方庆","name":"谢真人仙驾还旧山","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"何年成道去，绰约化童颜。\n天上辞仙侣，人间忆旧山。\n沧桑今已变，萝蔓尚堪攀。\n云覆瑶坛净，苔生丹竈闲。\n逍遥堪白石，寂寞闭玄关。\n应是悲尘世，思将羽驾还。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"夏方庆","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_18403.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18403","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}